 <!-- Content -->
    <div class="container" style="margin-top: 20px; background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6;">
        <h1>Adding a Grade to a Course</h1>
        <p>This is the page for learing how to add a grade to a course in the Course Grade Calculator.</p>
        <br>
        <p>To add a grade to a course, follow these steps:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Click on the course you want to add a grade to and click the "Input Grade" button.</li>
            <img src="/images/AddGradeLandingPage.png" alt="Landing Page of the Course Grade Calculator with Course Selected" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
            <li>It will take you to the add grade form.</li>
            <img src="/images/StartAddGrade.png" alt="Add Grade Form of the Course Grade Calculator" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
            <li>You must select a Subsection from the List to add a grade to.</li>
            <img src="/images/AddGradeSelectedSubsection.png" alt="Add Grade Form of the Course Grade Calculator with Subsection Selected" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
            <li>You will need to enter the grade name, maximum points, and actual points. Then you can press 'Add Grade'.</li>
            <img src="/images/AddGradeWithGradeInfo.png" alt="Add Grade Form of the Course Grade Calculator with Subsection Selected and Form Filled Out" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
            <li>To see the change in the course, you need to navigate to the course page and select the course.</li>
            <img src="/images/AverageGradeChanged.png" alt="Course Page of the Course Grade Calculator with New Grade Added" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Bootstrap core JavaScript -->
    <script src="/js/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
</body>
